BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Donors who make annual gifts of $2\,500 or more are members of the 1945 Society. Named for the year in which GDS was founded\, the 1945 Society was established to provide our School’s philanthropic leaders the opportunity to express their dedication & commitment to the founding families’ vision\, ideals\, & principles. Members of the 1945 Society\, & those who volunteered last year to secure foundational philanthropic support for the School\, will be celebrated at a reception hosted by the HoS & BoT.
