DESCRIPTION:The GDS College Counseling Office has partnered with The College Funding Coach\, financial experts in the field of college financing\, to help families understand the complex landscape of higher education financing\, learn about financial strategies that will allow them to utilize all of the avenues available to pay for college\, and optimize the potential to qualify for funding directly from colleges and universities (in the form of merit scholarships and need-based financial aid).
