BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:The Georgetown Day School Policy Institute is an incubator for activism. For four weeks each summer\, High School students from across the DMV learn about pressing social justice issues of global and/or national importance by working with advocates\, engaging in direct conversation with policymakers\, traveling to “ground zero” cities where the focus issue is most prevalent\, and building relationships with individuals at the heart of the issue.
