BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for the monthly SOC Mentoring session for MS students of color.  MS SOC Mentoring Program is open to all students of color in middle school. During MS SOC sessions\, students openly discuss their experiences and concerns as members of the GDS community. Students share their successes and accomplishments with one another while also learning how to use one another as resources in approaching challenges and developing effective problem-solving strategies.
